"Morrison Waker is the hero Big Snake, Texas state hero and a top-three US hero for a decade."
"He is a giant with a graying blond ponytail who greets people with Howdy."
"He is a Morph Brute: big makes him strong, little makes him fast, shifting in seconds."
"He carves state animals for charity and keeps a wolf reserve."
"A wizard's quest reward enlarged his wolves; he beat up the tank sent after them."
"Banished from Texas over it, he teaches third-year combat at CNH while it blows over."
"He also runs the self-defense session of first-year hero PE."
"He is known for charity work and nonlethal captures, and has a wizard friend."
"He wants to see Alden catch bullets."
"In late November he left for the Triplanets for at least a week, and Principal Saleh covered."
"He is half of the famous duo Big'nLittle Snake, and returned to teach after the flood."
